# Optional. Copy to `.env` (gitignored) and fill in if you want one.
#
# Without a token the GitHub API allows 60 requests/hour per IP and the build
# caches its results for 6 hours so repeated builds cannot exhaust that.
# With a token the limit is 5000/hour, the cache window drops to 30 minutes,
# and a build always sees fresh repository data.
#
# A fine-grained personal access token with read-only public access is enough —
# this build never writes to GitHub. Leave it unset and everything still works.
#
#   https://github.com/settings/tokens
#
GITHUB_TOKEN=